WEBVTT

00:27:59.265 --> 00:28:01.863
and a lot of our problems
are just caused by stupidity.

00:28:01.887 --> 00:28:04.687
There's a lot of greed, too,
I don't want to minimize that,

00:28:04.711 --> 00:28:07.500
but I do think that we do not
live in a zero-sum world.

00:28:07.524 --> 00:28:11.423
I don't think we live in a world
where conflict is the necessity.

00:28:11.447 --> 00:28:15.033
I'm an American Whig (Laughs),
a party that died,

00:28:15.057 --> 00:28:17.561
but I believe there's
a fundamental unity to America.

00:28:17.585 --> 00:28:19.270
CA: Some people listening will say,

00:28:19.294 --> 00:28:22.603
"Yeah, but come on. Here we are,
two white guys talking about this.

00:28:22.627 --> 00:28:28.719
You know, you haven't seen what others
have seen for their whole lives."

00:28:28.743 --> 00:28:31.443
Is there an argument that
there is a lot of truth